title: "Promislow-Fracton-Amoeba: Hantzsche-Wendt Group Rings, All-Prime Type-II Fracton Codes, and 3D Non-Hermitian B4 Eigenvalue Monodromy"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
